note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note TWIN of inline-depth4.om with every inline removed (section 4 line 97): same stdout.
note Contract section 4 lines 93-98 and 109-111: inlining at most 4 levels deep. main calls the
note inline chain f1 -> f2 -> f3 -> f4 (4 nested inlined bodies), which is within the bound and runs.
note f1 a = f2(3a)+1, f2 a = f3(5a)+2, f3 a = f4(7a)+3, f4 a = 11a+4; id is an ordinary call.
note Expected stdout: oracle/s3s4/exp/inline-depth4.out (python3, oracle/s3s4/oracle.py).
om2
fn f1 a ulong to ulong
ret add f2 mul a 3 1
end
fn f2 a ulong to ulong
ret add f3 mul a 5 2
end
fn f3 a ulong to ulong
ret add f4 mul a 7 3
end
fn f4 a ulong to ulong
ret add mul a 11 4
end
fn id v ulong to ulong
ret v
end
fn main to int
pu f1 2
pu f1 id 1000
ret 0
end
